  "notes": "Adds a normal Windows installer build for AO3 Skin Studio. Version 0.1.19 can be installed from a single AO3-Skin-Studio-Setup executable instead of extracting a ZIP. The installer uses a per-user install location, creates a Start Menu shortcut, optionally creates a desktop shortcut, carries the app icon, and can launch the app when setup finishes. The automatic updater remains unchanged for already-installed copies. Keeps the Randomizer, Glorious Purpose, Falling Angle, resizable header controls, Concepts / Starters, and all prior tools."
